Package: libpq-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: libpq5 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libssl-dev,
 postgresql-client-@MAJOR@ (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: header files for libpq5 (PostgreSQL library)
 Header files and static library for compiling C programs to link with the
 libpq library in order to communicate with a PostgreSQL database backend.

Package: libpq5
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: ca-certificates
Suggests: libpq-oauth
Description: PostgreSQL C client library
 libpq is a C library that enables user programs to communicate with the
 PostgreSQL database server.

Package: libpq-oauth
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: libpq5 (>= ${source:Upstream-Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: PostgreSQL libpq OAuth module
 Loadable module that lets libpq authenticate with OAuth bearer tokens. It is
 split from libpq5 so that libpq5 does not depend on libcurl.

Package: libecpg6
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: run-time library for ECPG programs
 The libecpg shared library is used by programs built with ECPG (Embedded
 PostgreSQL for C).

Package: libecpg-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: libecpg-compat3 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libecpg6 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libpgtypes3 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libpq-dev,
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: development files for ECPG (Embedded PostgreSQL for C)
 This package contains the files needed to build ECPG (Embedded PostgreSQL for
 C) programs.

Package: libecpg-compat3
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: older version of run-time library for ECPG programs
 The libecpg_compat shared library is used by ECPG programs that need
 compatibility with other embedded SQL systems.

Package: libpgtypes3
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: shared library libpgtypes for PostgreSQL @MAJOR@
 The libpgtypes shared library is used by ECPG programs for PostgreSQL data
 types.
